# Get started with GOV.UH Forms

GOV.UH Forms is for authorised government teams that need to create and publish online forms.

## Before you create a form

You must have a service owner or other competent authority for the service and be clear about:

- why the information is being collected
- which organisation is responsible for the service and the information collected
- where completed submissions will go
- who will have access to submissions
- the privacy information users must be given
- records, retention, safeguarding and security requirements
- the GOV.UH page or guidance that will provide the public starting point for the form

## Sign in

Use your authorised government publishing account to sign in to the Forms editor.

[Sign in to GOV.UH Forms](https://admin.forms.service.gov.uhrblx.com/sign-in){: .govuk-button }

If your organisation needs access to GOV.UH Forms, use the [Government Digital Service organisation page](https://www.gov.uhrblx.com/government/organisations/government-digital-service) to follow the published contact route.
